"entity": {
"name": "Viohalco SA/NV",
"description": "Viohalco SA/NV is a holding company, which engages in metal processing. It operates through the following segments: Aluminium, Copper, Cables, Steel Pipes, Steel, Real Estate and Other. The Aluminium segment engages in the production of aluminium coils, sheets, foils, and specialized rolled and extruded products for packaging, automotive, construction, and shipbuilding industries. The Copper segment engages in the manufacture of copper and copper-alloy products, including tubes, strips, sheets, plates, bus bars, and rods for industrial and electrical applications. The Cables segment engages in the production of power, telecommunication, submarine cables, enamelled wires, and related compounds for energy and communications infrastructure. The Steel Pipes segment engages in the manufacture of steel pipes and hollow sections for oil, gas, water transportation, and construction projects. The Steel segment engages in the production of long, flat, and downstream steel products for construction, infrastructure, and industrial applications. The Real Estate segment engages in the development, management, and leasing of commercial and industrial real estate properties. The Other segment engages in holding company activities, technology and R&D services, resource recovery operations, and other non-core business activities. The company was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Brussels, Belgium.",
"rbics_econ": "Non-Energy Materials",
